For those who have pushed the move every Friday, all I would like to share is that when the country lagoons in Brexit, which will hurt our households, businesses and public services, I don’t look forward to wasting my time and energy in loyalty to the Labour Party’s leadership.
But in fact, a message outside the Nottingham Momentum that I am on, addressed to my constituents, whether a member of the Labour Party or not: I am proud to serve and I promise that there will be no threat of elimination or any political means to prevent me from acting for what I believe is the greatest benefit to my relatives.
Chris Leslie is a Congressman of Nottingham East.
